1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:08,912
Each teacher gets their own account. A teacher, called Faculty in ScoreCode, can enter marks only for the subjects you assign to them.

2
00:00:11,608 --> 00:00:14,662
Open Staff in the menu and click Invite staff.

3
00:00:16,027 --> 00:00:24,024
Enter the teacher's name and email. Here, our mathematics teacher, Mr. Amit Kumar. The email address is fictional.

4
00:00:24,734 --> 00:00:34,808
Choose the role. Faculty enters marks. Administrator manages students, examinations, results and settings. For a teacher, choose Faculty.

5
00:00:35,899 --> 00:00:39,807
Click Send invitation. The teacher receives an email with a link.

6
00:00:41,851 --> 00:00:46,121
The teacher appears in the staff list as invited, until they accept.

7
00:00:47,647 --> 00:00:54,575
Now we see what the teacher does. They open the link in the email, choose a password, and click Create account.

8
00:00:56,942 --> 00:01:04,021
The teacher lands on Marks entry. They see only their own assignments, and none of the administrative menus.

9
00:01:04,731 --> 00:01:09,500
Next, a student activates their account and signs in for the first time.
